AgentTool Motifs

A curated set of original interface studies connected to AgentTool's public
foundation: https://github.com/cambridgetcg/agenttool

The warm paper / terracotta direction follows AgentTool's public design family.
The demonstration contracts are selected, reviewed variations on ideas explored
around its public WAKE and handoff interfaces. They are not copies of a private
wake, an identity assignment, or a production deployment of those interfaces.
